  "prompt": "The function\n[Figure 1]\nis defined by\n[Figure 2]\n, where\n[Figure 3]\n,\n[Figure 4]\n, and\n[Figure 5]\nare positive integers. In the xy-plane, the graph of\n[Figure 6]\npasses through the points\n[Figure 7]\nand\n[Figure 8]\n. If\n[Figure 9]\nand\n[Figure 10]\nhave no common factors and\n[Figure 11]\n, what is the value of\n[Figure 12]\n?",
